1
00:00:00,162 --> 00:00:02,042
- Did not.
- Did too.

2
00:00:02,206 --> 00:00:04,586
Okay, maybe some of it. But...

3
00:00:04,750 --> 00:00:07,090
(Leonard:)The guy was just in the right place
at the right time...

4
00:00:07,253 --> 00:00:09,963
(Leonard:)...with the right paradigm-shifting
reinterpretation of the universe.

5
00:00:10,131 --> 00:00:12,011
(Leonard:)He got lucky.

6
00:00:12,424 --> 00:00:13,594
(Raj:)In more ways than one.

7
00:00:14,218 --> 00:00:16,508
(Raj:)He's a very handsome man.

8
00:00:17,096 --> 00:00:19,426
(Howard:)Doesn't do anything for me.
If I was gonna go that way...

9
00:00:19,598 --> 00:00:22,598
...I'm more of a Zac Efron kind of guy.

10
00:00:24,562 --> 00:00:26,982
(Raj:)Oh, yeah.
Like you have a shot with Zac Efron.

11
00:00:28,482 --> 00:00:31,112
(David(approaching):)Excuse me. Are you Leonard Hofstadter?

12
00:00:31,277 --> 00:00:33,607
- Uh, yeah.
- I'm David Underhill.

13
00:00:33,779 --> 00:00:36,949
Uh, yeah. Heh, heh.

14
00:00:37,116 --> 00:00:40,326
(David:)Dr. Gablehauser said
if I wanted to set up something in the lab...

15
00:00:40,494 --> 00:00:42,454
(David:)...that you'd be able to give me a hand?

16
00:00:42,621 --> 00:00:45,041
- You wanna work with me?
- If you have time, yeah.

17
00:00:45,207 --> 00:00:49,507
Wow. Yeah, sure. Yeah, no problem.

18
00:00:49,670 --> 00:00:53,970
Um, here's my home number,
here's my cell, here's my office...

19
00:00:54,133 --> 00:00:57,133
(Leonard:)...here's my parents' number
up in New Jersey.

20
00:00:57,303 --> 00:00:58,843
- They know how to reach me.
DAVID: Okay.

21
00:00:59,013 --> 00:01:02,013
(Leonard:)Congratulations on the MacArthur grant,
by the way. Big fan.

22
00:01:02,183 --> 00:01:04,143
(David:)Thanks. I'll call you.

23
00:01:04,310 --> 00:01:05,770
(Howard:)Okay.

24
00:01:05,936 --> 00:01:07,226
(Leonard:)Bye-bye.

25
00:01:12,109 --> 00:01:16,029
(Leonard:)What are you looking at?
You've never seen a hypocrite before?

